ignore:
  SNYK-JS-LEAFLET-16427276:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          CVE-2025-69993: XSS through HTML strings passed to bindPopup. The wedding demo's
          venue map (src/components/wedding-demo/places-map.tsx) builds its popups from DOM
          nodes filled with textContent, never from HTML, and its only HTML is the static
          OpenStreetMap attribution. No fixed version of leaflet exists yet: review again
          on expiry.
